  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Diagnostic cost per sample of whole-genome sequencing (WGS) on Illumina NextSeq, Illumina MiSeq and Nanopore MinION, and of the phenotypic DST comparator, as reported by five included studies (2021 USD).",
